{"parse": {"title": "独一调·【尽杯酌】", "pageid": 25341, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Item-140008.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Item-140008.png\">独一调·【尽杯酌】</a></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>独一调·【尽杯酌】</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#140008</div></div><hr /><div>毋须编织的、独一无二的线，可在【尽杯酌】征集中使纺车转动一周。<br /><span style=\"color:#AC5320\">仅限用于【尽杯酌】中征集角色。</span>【尽杯酌】限时征集结束后，<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">该道具过期。</span></div><div style=\"color:#696969\">兔子依旧是兔子。尽管它陌生而醒目地闪烁着，可仍是你的好朋友。它时髦，活跃，对湖泊充满渴望，并知晓你也如此。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "独一调·【尽杯酌】"}}